sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as Webhook Deployment<br/>443/TCP TLS
    participant Controller as Controller Deployment
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager
    participant OSConfig as OpenShift APIServer<br/>config.openshift.io/v1
    participant Module as Spark Operator Module
    participant ODH as ODH Operator

    Note over User, Controller: Flow 1: Spark Workload Submission

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply SparkApplication CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Mutating webhook<br/>/mutate-sparkoperator-k8s-io-v1beta2-sparkapplication<br/>failurePolicy: Fail
    Webhook->>K8sAPI: Check ResourceQuota<br/>list resourcequotas
    K8sAPI-->>Webhook: Quota info
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated CR (defaults injected)
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Validating webhook<br/>/validate-sparkoperator-k8s-io-v1beta2-sparkapplication<br/>failurePolicy: Fail
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Validation result
    K8sAPI-->>User: CR persisted

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch SparkApplication
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: SparkApplication event
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Driver Pod
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Executor Pods
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Service
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Ingress
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create PodDisruptionBudget
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Update SparkApplication/status

    Note over User, Controller: Flow 2: SparkConnect Session

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply SparkConnect CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Mutating + Validating webhooks
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Accepted
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch SparkConnect
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: SparkConnect event
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create ConfigMap
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Service (connection endpoint)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Update SparkConnect/status

    Note over Module, ODH: Flow 3: Platform Lifecycle Management

    ODH->>K8sAPI: Create SparkOperator CR<br/>(cluster-scoped)
    Module->>K8sAPI: Watch SparkOperator
    K8sAPI-->>Module: SparkOperator event
    Module->>K8sAPI: Deploy controller Deployment
    Module->>K8sAPI: Deploy webhook Deployment
    Module->>K8sAPI: Create RBAC (ClusterRoles, Bindings)
    Module->>K8sAPI: Create CRDs
    Module->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicies
    Module->>CertMgr: Create Certificate + Issuer CRs
    CertMgr-->>Module: Certificates provisioned
    Module->>K8sAPI: Create PodMonitors
    Module->>K8sAPI: Update SparkOperator/status<br/>(via PlatformObject interface)

    Note over Webhook, OSConfig: Flow 4: TLS Configuration

    Webhook->>K8sAPI: Get APIServer "cluster"<br/>(config.openshift.io/v1)
    K8sAPI-->>Webhook: TLS profile (min version, cipher suites)
    Note over Webhook: Configure TLS 1.2+ min<br/>with cluster-aligned ciphers
    Note over Webhook: Fallback: TLS 1.2 min<br/>if APIServer unavailable
